# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer builds' tests.
#
# Creating an SDL window and renderer can load the system's graphics driver
# (Mesa, EGL), which keeps one-time allocations for the life of the process
# and never frees them. They show up as leaks whose allocation stacks pass
# through the EGL libraries, or SDL's code that loads them (SDL is linked
# into the tests); the game's own allocations never do.
leak:libEGL
leak:SDL_EGL_
